<title><![CDATA[China’s new-home prices fall for 40th straight month as stimulus fails to lift demand]]></title>
<link>https://www.scmp.com/economy/china-economy/article/3369080/chinas-new-home-prices-fall-40th-straight-month</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.scmp.com/economy/china-economy/article/3369080/chinas-new-home-prices-fall-40th-straight-month</guid>
<description><![CDATA[Prices of new homes across 70 major cities slipped 0.4 per cent in August from July, according to the statistics bureau, extending a slump that began in 2023 despite mortgage rate cuts and eased purchase restrictions.]]></description>
